# UI / Design system

- Tailwind for layout, spacing, responsive structure. MUI for complex controls: DataGrid, Dialog, Drawer,
  Autocomplete, DatePicker, advanced form inputs.
- Brand tokens live in `resources/js/theme/tokens.js` and are mirrored in `resources/css/app.css` `@theme`.
  Change both together. Use `brand-*` / `accent-*` Tailwind colors and MUI `primary`/`secondary` — no ad-hoc hex values.
- CSS layers: `theme, base, mui, components, utilities` — Tailwind utilities override MUI without `!important`.
- Do not add MUI `CssBaseline` (Tailwind preflight is the reset). Custom CSS only when unavoidable.
- Mobile-first: every business screen must work on phone, tablet, laptop, desktop. Test at 360px width.
- Audience is non-technical local business owners: plain language, few steps, clear primary action.
  Dashboards answer: what happened, what needs attention, what to do, what was automated.
- Every page: loading, empty, error, permission-denied, validation states. Forms show loading + success feedback.
- Tables: search, filters, pagination, sorting (and bulk actions where useful).
- Reuse shared components in `resources/js/components/` before creating new ones.
